@cmwl1231/dsh-notify README · dsh-notify：Desktop notifications for [DeepSeek-Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) (DSH) on Windows and macOS.

中文文档：[README.zh-CN.md](./README.zh-CN.md)

Hand a task to DSH, switch to something else, and get pulled back only when it matters: a toast tells you the task is done, or that the agent is waiting on you. Click the toast to return to the app.

> Windows 10/11 and macOS. Linux loads the plugin but cannot deliver a toast;
> its settings page still opens and says so.

@cmwl1231/dsh-notify README · toast payload and encoding checks (Windows, sends one real toast)：powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File test-toast.ps1
```

`notify.ps1` must keep its UTF-8 BOM. Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads a `.ps1` file in the system code page unless a BOM says otherwise, and the action label is Chinese — without the BOM it renders as mojibake. The test suite checks this.

@cmwl1231/dsh-notify README · dsh-notify：给 [DeepSeek-Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)（下称 DSH）用的桌面通知插件，支持 Windows 和 macOS。

把任务交给 DSH，然后去忙别的事。只有当真的需要你时才把你拉回来：任务完成了，或者助手正等着你回答，都会弹一个通知。点一下通知就回到 DSH。

> 支持 Windows 10/11 和 macOS。Linux 上插件能加载但不会弹通知；设置页照常打开并说明原因。

@cmwl1231/dsh-notify README · 通知载荷与编码检查（Windows，会真的发一条通知）：powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File test-toast.ps1
```

`notify.ps1` 必须保留 UTF-8 BOM。Windows PowerShell 5.1 读 `.ps1` 时，如果没有 BOM 就按系统代码页解析，而按钮文字是中文，没有 BOM 就会变成乱码。测试里有专门一项守着这个。

